      "DAS28-ESR change from baseline: -1.71 (2x0.5g), -1.68 (2x1.0g) vs -0.76 (placebo) at Week 24",
      "Median time to CD19+ B-cell repletion: 110.3 weeks (2x0.5g) and 109.6 weeks (2x1.0g)",
      "Post-rituximab low immunoglobulin: 5.1% vs pre-rituximab 0.2%"
